#: ../../tools/gene2phenotype_tools.rst:32 c35e7399dee74ce58f03cf63d481940e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get Gene2Phenotype information for a specific gene by "
"symbol. Returns gene location, cross-references to HGNC/Ensembl/OMIM, "
"gene synonyms, and genomic coordinates. This provides the gene-level data"
" without disease associations. For disease associations, use G2P\\_search"
" with the gene name instead."
msgstr ""

