#: ../../tools/gene2phenotype_tools.rst:94 cbd060a0e18640fcadf32916d28ab021
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed Gene2Phenotype (G2P) record for a specific "
"gene-disease association by its stable ID. Returns comprehensive clinical"
" genetics information including locus details (gene symbol, genomic "
"coordinates, cross-references), genotype/inheritance pattern, variant "
"consequences (with Sequence Ontology terms), molecular mechanism with "
"evidence, disease details with ontology terms, confidence level, and "
"supporting publications. Use G2P\\_search first to find stable IDs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/gene2phenotype_tools.rst:98 836170168d2749749173a2913296c39d
msgid ""
"``stable_id`` (string) (required) G2P stable identifier (e.g., "
"'G2P01796', 'G2P00119', 'G2P00979'). Get IDs from G2P\\_search results."
msgstr ""

